SourceLight — Third-Party Software Notices
=========================================

This file lists the third-party open-source components compiled into SourceLight
and reproduces their licences, as those licences require. It is generated from
the dependency graph by cargo-about (see src-tauri/about.toml).

SourceLight itself is free and open-source software under the Mozilla Public
License 2.0, whose text is in LICENSE.txt, installed beside this file.

These shipped components are NOT listed here because they are loaded as
separate shared libraries rather than compiled in, and are documented in
NOTICE.txt, installed beside this file:

  - LibRaw (LGPL-2.1) — libraw.dll; notices in LICENSE.LibRaw.txt / COPYRIGHT.LibRaw.txt
  - ONNX Runtime (MIT) — onnxruntime.dll; notices shipped alongside the library
  - DirectML (Microsoft redistributable licence) — DirectML.dll; notices
    shipped alongside the library

The on-device AI models are downloaded from their original providers when first
needed and are not distributed with the application, except the small face
models below, which the installer carries (models/faces/).

